(633, 'vulture_leap_slam', 'Leap Slam', 'Jump into the air, damaging enemies (and knocking back some) with your weapon where you land. Enemies you would land on are pushed out of the way. Requires an axe, mace, sword or staff.', 13, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/iconleapslam.dds', '[16]', '[0,7,19,23,33,78,91,14]', '[9,10,11,12,32,14,15,16,17,57]', 'Long ago, the marauders of Oriath perfected a devastating battle technique - the ferocious Leap Slam. With a guttural cry, the leaper hurtles forward and smashes the ground at the feet of the enemy. The force from this blow deals substantial damage in a circle around the targeted spot, and will even knock back and stun. The Leap Slam is useful not only as an offensive technique, but also because it can serve, in a pinch, to escape from danger. The Marauders of Oriath were famous for attacking their foes from above, leaping down from high ledges to crush their enemies'' skulls.', 'http://s3.amazonaws.com/pathofexile/image/skills/strength/leap_slam.jpg', 1, 'LeapSlam', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, 0, 0, '', '[2,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,28,14,15,35]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(634, 'curse_consume', 'Curse Consume', '', 372, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/FleshOffering.dds', '[2]', '[1,4]', '[]', '', '', 1, 'CurseConsume', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(635, 'rolling_magma', 'Rolling Magma', 'Lob a fiery orb that deals area damage as it hits the ground. The skill chains, bouncing forward to deal damage multiple times.', 373, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/FireMortar.dds', '[1,2]', '[1,6,7,13,15,14,31,28,2,56,21,18,69,71]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[4056,4319,4243,5746,11977,11980,18224,18225]', '[24,174,436,175,11978,11981,18136,3947]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, 7, 0, '', '[3,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,27,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
