(738, 'vaal_earthquake', 'Vaal Earthquake', 'Smashes the ground, dealing damage in an area and cracking the earth. The crack will erupt in a powerful aftershock after a short duration. After using this skill, your steps will deal damage around you, cracking the earth if the previous cracks have erupted. This effect ends after a secondary duration, or after a maximum number of aftershocks. Requires an Axe, Mace, Sceptre, Staff or Unarmed.', 429, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/QuakeSlam.dds', '[1,2]', '[0,7,19,8,37,91,14,121]', '[11,12,32,14,16,17,36,57]', '', '', 1, 'VaalEarthquakeFootstep', 0, 22, 1, '[4136,4420,4448,12402,18198]', '[24,217,436,12401,18120]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[2,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,28,14,15,35]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
