(1279, 'aspect_cat', 'Aspect of the Cat', 'While active, grants the Cat''s Stealth and Cat''s Agility buffs in sequence. Cat''s Stealth increases your critical strike chance, makes you harder to see, and gives you a chance to avoid damage for a short duration. Cat''s Agility increases your attack and cast speed for a longer secondary duration.', 842, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/CatAspect.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,8,63,84,85,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, 'CatAspect', 0, 22, 1, '[7568,7569,12990,17155,22988]', '[358,14217,3248,348,4602]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1280, 'aspect_bird', 'Aspect of the Avian', 'While active, grants the Avian''s Might and Avian''s Flight buffs in sequence. Avian''s Might grants you and your minions a chance to deal Double Damage with hits for a duration. Avian''s Flight grants you and your minions increased Movement Speed for a secondary duration.', 843, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/AvianAspect.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,8,63,84,85,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, 'BirdAspect', 0, 22, 1, '[7556,7555,7562,21155]', '[358,3248,4602,14217]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1281, 'aspect_spider', 'Aspect of the Spider', 'While active, periodically applies a Spider''s Web debuff to nearby Enemies, and Hinders them. Each Spider''s Web on an Enemy increases the Damage they take. Hinder reduces their movement speed.', 844, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/SpiderAspect.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,8,63,84,85,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, 'SpiderAspect', 0, 22, 1, '[7745,7775,7842,21157,22989]', '[170,436,7744,14217,4602]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1282, 'aspect_crab', 'Aspect of the Crab', 'While active, periodically adds Crab Barriers to you, and grants additional Physical Damage reduction for each Crab Barrier you have. All Crab Barriers are lost when you take physical damage from a hit.', 845, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/CrabAspect.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,63,27,84,85,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, 'CrabAspect', 0, 22, 1, '[7843,22987]', '[7535,4602]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1283, 'aspect_brine_king', 'Aspect of the Brine King', 'While active, inflicts Chill on enemies within it''s radius, while also increasing the strength of Chill you inflict and causing Damage you deal to Chilled enemies to penetrate some of their Cold Resistance.', 1345, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/PanethonDucatBrineKing.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,63,29,84,85,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1284, 'aspect_lunaris', 'Aspect of Lunaris', 'While active, taking Physical or Elemental Damage will grant you either Lunar Protection or Lunar Resistance, respectively. Aspect of Lunaris lessens incoming Physical Damage for each Lunar Protection on you, and lessens incoming Elemental Damage for each Lunar Resistance on you. These buffs can both stack up to eight times.', 1347, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/PanethonDucatLunaris.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,8,89,84,85]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1285, 'aspect_solaris', 'Aspect of Solaris', 'While active, inflicts Fire Exposure on enemies within its radius. Additionally, periodically applies a Sunscald debuff to enemies within its radius, with each Sunscald debuff increasing the effect of exposure on affected enemies. Sunscald can stack up to five times.', 1346, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/PanethonDucatSolaris.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,63,28,84,85,89,8]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1286, 'aspect_arakaali', 'Aspect of Arakaali', 'While active, you inflict Wither on hit, and Wither you inflict will be reflected back to you. Additionally, for each stack of Wither on you, your Life recovery rate is increased.', 1348, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/PanethonDucatArakaali.dds', '[4]', '[4,1,11,63,41,84,85,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
