(855, 'summon_lightning_golem', 'Summon Lightning Golem', 'Summons a Lightning Golem that grants you increased attack and cast speed, and mana regeneration. The Lightning Golem fires a projectile spell, creates orbs of Lightning that zap nearby enemies, and casts a temporary aura that grants added Lightning Damage to spells and attacks used by the Golem and its nearby allies.', 495, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/LightningGolem.dds', '[1]', '[31,30,15,5,17,21,1,14,13,50,76,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[5211]', '[3396]', '[6,7,38,2,56,8,1,4]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(856, 'summon_lightning_golem_alt_x', 'Summon Lightning Golem of Hordes', 'Summons a Lightning Golem. The Lightning Golem fires a projectile spell, creates orbs of Lightning that zap nearby enemies, and casts a temporary aura that grants added Lightning Damage to spells and attacks used by the Golem and its nearby allies.', 495, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/LightningGolem.dds', '[1]', '[31,30,15,5,17,21,1,14,13,50,76,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[5211]', '[3396]', '[6,7,38,2,56,8,1,4]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, 855, ''),
(857, 'summon_lightning_golem_alt_y', '[DNT] SummonLightningGolemAltY', 'Summons a Lightning Golem that grants you increased attack and cast speed, and mana regeneration. The Lightning Golem fires a projectile spell, creates orbs of Lightning that zap nearby enemies, and casts a temporary aura that grants added Lightning Damage to spells and attacks used by the Golem and its nearby allies.', 495, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/LightningGolem.dds', '[1]', '[31,30,15,5,17,21,1,14,13,50,76,89]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[5211]', '[3396]', '[6,7,38,2,56,8,1,4]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, 855, ''),
(858, 'chronos_statues_cast', 'WIP', '', 496, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/FireElementalSummon.dds', '[4]', '[]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(859, 'izaro_temporal_chains', 'Temporal Chains', '', 79, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/temporalchains.dds', '[4]', '[1,7,8,13,14,15,21,31,68,71,96]', '[]', 'This useful curse warps a small area of space and actually causes time to pass slower within its confines. Any beings who pass through the affected zone will become snared in the warp, slowing their actions to a crawl.', 'http://s3.amazonaws.com/pathofexile/image/skills/dexterity/temporal_chains.jpg', 1, 'TemporalChains', 1, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(860, 'izaro_vulnerability', 'Vulnerability', '', 86, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/vulnerability.dds', '[4]', '[1,7,8,13,14,15,21,31,68,71,96]', '[]', 'Though they generally feared sorcery, even the Marauders came to learn the value of the powerful Vulnerability Curse. Before charging into battle, a caster on the front lines would speak the curse, throwing it far and wide on their assembled enemies. The Marauders would come on with a roar, a tidal wave of rage and steel crashing against their foes. The Vulnerability curse could hardly be seen, but its effects were dire. Blows from the Marauders hit far harder, sundering helm and shield like tin. Those not killed immediately would be stunned inert, unable to defend themselves from the onslaught. Even masters of magic were vulnerable, for the curse corrupted the force of their protective shields.', 'http://s3.amazonaws.com/pathofexile/image/skills/intelligence/vulnerability.jpg', 1, 'Vulnerability', 1, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(861, 'izaro_elemental_weakness', 'Elemental Weakness', '', 80, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/elementalweakness.dds', '[4]', '[1,7,8,13,14,15,21,31,68,71,96]', '[]', 'A favorite of Witches and other masters of magic, the Elemental Weakness curse strips away resistances to cold, fire and lightning. Once afflicted by the curse, an enemy will suffer grievous harm from any elemental attack, even if they have natural resistances.', 'http://s3.amazonaws.com/pathofexile/image/skills/intelligence/elemental_weakness.jpg', 1, 'ElementalWeakness', 1, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
