(1643, 'void_sphere', 'Void Sphere', 'Creates a Void Sphere which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the sphere. It also regularly releases pulses of area damage. The Void Sphere will consume the corpses of any enemies which die in its area. Can only have one Void Sphere at a time.', 1074, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/BlackHole2.dds', '[1,22]', '[1,7,13,15,31,8,71,89,14,27,6,41,99]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13239]', '[3396]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[3,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,27,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1644, 'void_sphere_alt_x', 'Void Sphere of Rending', 'Creates a Void Sphere which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the sphere. It also regularly releases pulses of area damage. The Void Sphere will consume the corpses of any enemies which die in its area. Can only have one Void Sphere at a time.', 1074, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/BlackHole2.dds', '[1,22]', '[1,7,13,15,31,8,71,14,27,6,41,99]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13239]', '[3396]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[3,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,27,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, 1643, ''),
(1645, 'void_sphere_alt_y', '[DNT] VoidSphereAltY', 'Creates a Void Sphere which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the sphere. It also regularly releases pulses of area damage. The Void Sphere will consume the corpses of any enemies which die in its area. Can only have one Void Sphere at a time.', 1074, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/BlackHole2.dds', '[1,22]', '[1,7,13,15,31,8,71,89,14,27,6,41,99]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13239]', '[3396]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[3,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,27,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, 1643, ''),
(1646, 'abyssal_well', 'Abyssal Maw', 'Creates an Abyssal Maw which Hinders enemies in an area around it, with the debuff being stronger on enemies closer to the Maw. Pulses from the Maw will draw enemies in, while also inflicting a potent damage over time debuff. The Maw will consume any corpses within its area. Can only have one Maw at a time.', 1074, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/BlackHole2.dds', '[1,22]', '[1,7,31,8,71,89,41,99,36,49,114,34]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 0, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[16,10,11,17,12,13]', 0, 1, 1, NULL, ''),
(1647, 'crackling_lance', 'Crackling Lance', 'Release a beam which deals lightning damage to enemies in a long area in front of you, and has several smaller beams branch off from it at an angle, hitting more enemies to the sides.', 1075, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/Disentegrate.dds', '[1,2]', '[1,7,6,30,13,15,14,31,71,21,69,127]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13240,13241,18227,18228]', '[24,218,18138,14194]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[3,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,27,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1648, 'crackling_lance_alt_x', 'Crackling Lance of Branching', 'Release a beam which deals lightning damage to enemies in a long area in front of you, and has several smaller beams branch off from it at an angle, hitting more enemies to the sides.', 1075, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/Disentegrate.dds', '[1,2]', '[1,7,6,30,13,15,14,31,71,21,69]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13240,13241,18227,18228]', '[24,218,18138,14194]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[3,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,27,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, 1647, ''),
(1649, 'crackling_lance_alt_y', 'Crackling Lance of Disintegration', 'Release a concentrated beam which deals lightning damage to enemies in a long area in front of you.', 1075, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/Disentegrate.dds', '[1,2]', '[1,7,6,30,13,15,14,31,71,21,69]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13240,13241,18227,18228]', '[24,218,18138,14194]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[3,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,27,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, 1647, ''),
(1650, 'frost_shield', 'Frost Shield', 'Place a Frost Shield that drains your energy shield for one second or until you run out, gaining stages while this drain occurs. The Frost Shield takes some damage from hits in place of you and allies while in its area. Enemies in the area are Chilled. You can only have one Frost Shield active at once.', 1076, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/FrostGlobe.dds', '[4]', '[1,7,8,13,15,31,71,89,29,14,67,66,16,22]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 1, 22, 1, '[13242]', '[10041]', '[]', 1, 1, '[12542]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1651, 'splitting_steel', 'Splitting Steel', 'Fire a single projectile that splits on impact or at the targeted location, dealing area damage when it splits and again when the split projectiles explode at the end of their flight. Projectiles from this skill cannot return. Requires a Sword or Axe.', 1077, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/ImpactingSteelSkill.dds', '[1,2]', '[0,40,2,56,7,27,59,123]', '[9,10,15,11,16]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13194,13243,13244]', '[13187,24,436]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[2,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,28,14,15,35]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1652, 'splitting_steel_alt_x', 'Splitting Steel of Ammunition', 'Consume Steel Shards to fire a single projectile that splits on impact or at the targeted location, dealing area damage when it splits and again when the split projectiles explode at the end of their flight. Projectiles from this skill cannot return. Requires a Sword or Axe. Steel Shards are gained with the Call of Steel Skill.', 1077, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/ImpactingSteelSkill.dds', '[1,2]', '[0,40,2,56,95,7,27,59,123]', '[9,10,15,11,16]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13194,13243,13244]', '[13187,24,436]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[2,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,28,14,15,35]', 0, 0, 1, 1651, ''),
(1653, 'splitting_steel_alt_y', '[DNT] SplittingSteelAltY', 'Fire a single projectile that splits on impact or at the targeted location, dealing area damage when it splits and again when the split projectiles explode at the end of their flight. Projectiles from this skill cannot return. Requires a Sword or Axe.', 1077, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/ImpactingSteelSkill.dds', '[1,2]', '[0,40,2,56,7,27,59,123]', '[9,10,15,11,16]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13194,13243,13244]', '[13187,24,436]', '[]', 1, 1, '[]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[2,18,29,10,11,16,17,19,26,28,14,15,35]', 0, 0, 1, 1651, ''),
(1654, 'sigil_of_power', 'Sigil of Power', 'Places a Sigil on the ground, which grants a buff to you and allies in the area around it for a duration. The Sigil gains stages as you spend mana in its area, making the buff more powerful. You can only have one Sigil of Power at a time.', 1078, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/CircleofPower.dds', '[4]', '[1,7,8,13,15,31,71,89,14,30,103]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[13231]', 8, NULL, 0, 'Metadata/Monsters/Totems/SigilofPowerTotem.ais', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1655, 'flame_wall', 'Flame Wall', 'Create a wall of fire for a duration, which deals burning damage to everything in its area. Each enemy that enters the wall also receives a secondary burning debuff which persists for a short duration after leaving the wall. Any projectiles fired through the wall by you and allies deal added fire damage and apply the wall''s secondary debuff on hit.', 1079, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/Firewall.dds', '[1,22]', '[1,34,7,8,13,15,31,71,14,28,48,69,21,55,24]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13245]', '[24]', '[]', 1, 1, '[12664,13246,13247]', 8, 2, 0, '', '[16,10,11,17,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(1656, 'flame_wall_alt_x', '[DNT] Flame Wall of Forking', 'Create a wall of fire for a duration, which deals burning damage to everything in its area. Each enemy that enters the wall also receives a secondary burning debuff which persists for a short duration after leaving the wall. Any projectiles fired through the wall by you and allies fork, deal added fire damage and apply the wall''s secondary debuff on hit.', 1079, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/Firewall.dds', '[1,22]', '[1,34,7,8,13,15,31,71,14,28,48,69,21,55,24]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13245]', '[24]', '[]', 1, 1, '[12664,13246,13247]', 8, 2, 0, '', '[16,10,11,17,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, 1655, ''),
(1657, 'flame_wall_alt_y', '[DNT] Flame Wall of Surging', '[DNT] Create a wall of fire for a duration that moves forward over time, which deals burning damage to everything in its area. Each enemy that enters the wall also receives a secondary burning debuff which persists for a short duration after leaving the wall.', 1079, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/Firewall.dds', '[1,22]', '[1,34,7,8,13,15,31,71,14,28,48,69,21,55,24]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[13245]', '[24]', '[]', 1, 1, '[12664,13246,13247]', 8, 2, 0, '', '[16,10,11,17,12,13]', 0, 0, 1, 1655, ''),
