(1660, 'call_of_steel', 'Call of Steel', 'Calls impale debuffs from enemies, alive or dead, in a large area around you to gain steel shards. Deals reflected damage in a smaller area around each such enemy based on the impales removed from them. Continues to grant shards over time until you reach maximum or spend them.', 1081, 'Art/2DArt/SkillIcons/CallOfSteelSkill.dds', '[4]', '[89,7,95]', '[]', '', '', 1, '', 0, 22, 1, '[]', '[]', '[]', 1, 1, '[12844,12845,13319]', 8, NULL, 0, '', '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, ''),
